1. error-review.tsx: the drill panel showed the context sentence VERBATIM before
   reveal, spoiling the drilled form when the sentence contains it. Fix:
   blankedContext() blanks the surface out of the sentence pre-reveal; when the
   context IS the form itself (lexicon-origin card, D4) or blanking is impossible,
   the prompt honestly names just the lemma. Tests rewritten to pin this
   ("Я читаю ____" pre-reveal, never "книги"), plus a new lexicon-origin case.
2. journeys/harness.tsx: the error_review_accept fake's context_text now contains
   the drilled form (mirrors lib.rs, where the context resolves to the sentence
   the form appeared in), so the journey exercises the blanking path.
